{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:29d87f64ef83b8f1c60e9e9cb9497aedf775c9727fbc2cc8cde7da2e273522d5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9e45cb22b03c4e2cd4fa9eee2243f50d0e94d1e901e5c99b8d24d2da54c5660",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n这是白色情人节的回礼。请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e33718f5e3a1921d290973a49ea8e18dd9fae79aa5d437c7d1bde5d5577af86c",
      "text": "我想起了之前一起去买西装时的事，\n就选了丝巾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e7da8807c1e01d75a5a07a7e8222efe8d4f5ca3402b44b328cc73a9d3a07cde",
      "text": "辉先生，非常感谢！我会好好珍惜使用的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:925390404587f5946d66e02833f0cec3adda2d71d63a14c5bbb738caf74e2b08",
      "text": "在看到那条丝巾的瞬间，\n你的面容一下子就浮现在我脑海中了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09ca7a44bcf21e08e4a16b455d05f8ee6b44173d3936f45ca4de056ef0d22e9f",
      "text": "我就觉得如果要送礼物的话，绝对非它莫属了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64efbf6c258021370d0a0106f8dc2b17e7e5b4435a6b2eb5f67a05b95b40d634",
      "text": "我想跟之前一起定制的西装也很搭哦。\n不介意的话就试着搭配看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f7621dc44ee6117942cf0176c1fc32fb7a253cfbb1f07252cb02f3ad6d9eea6",
      "text": "好的。其实，我也给辉先生准备了回礼哦。\n这份点心，请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b7607ef8a5a4991a8adae616017d4e345060a1eba332c436e8f280757b53057",
      "text": "诶，是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:464c893adf63af0fbf6b60840c99c4e9c0e32edc0e9cc021ff98f09e154ec386",
      "text": "是的！因为在情人节收到了点心，\n所以就准备了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:300c3af56ccdd6113427c59b9ca7cc16d70a795d1e2ee90187e628e338434ebc",
      "text": "哈哈，结果又变成互相交换了啊！\n嘛不过，这样的白色情人节也挺有趣的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_004_23_5_02_004_23:5_02_004_23:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03a542faa3f4357d34752f40a4dd4199ce148de73cbb01e46e22881fecd73ff4",
      "text": "多谢啦，●●●●プロデューサー。\n这个我也一定会好好享用的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
